code>: </span><span class="cs1-visible-error citation-comment" about="#mwt604" id="mwFVM">Cite uses deprecated parameter <code class="cs1-code" id="mwFVQ"><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwFVU">|</span>citeseerx=</code> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Help:CS1_errors#deprecated_params" title="Help:CS1 errors" id="mwFVY">help</a>)</span><link rel="mw:PageProp/Category" href="./Category:CS1_errors:_deprecated_parameters" about="#mwt604" id="mwFVc"/></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-171" id="cite_note-171" data-mw-footnote-number="170"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwFVg"><a href="#cite_ref-171" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwFVk"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwFVo">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-171" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt608" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwFVs" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite journal ","href":"./Template:Cite_journal"},"params":{"title":{"wt":"Babylonian Observational Astronomy"},"first":{"wt":"A."},"last":{"wt":"Sachs"},"journal":{"wt":"[[Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society]]"},"volume":{"wt":"276"},"issue":{"wt":"1257"},"date":{"wt":"2 May 1974"},"pages":{"wt":"43–50 [45 &amp; 48–49]"},"jstor":{"wt":"74273"},"doi":{"wt":"10.1098/rsta.1974.0008"},"bibcode":{"wt":"1974RSPTA.276...43S"},"s2cid":{"wt":"121539390"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFSachs1974" class="citation journal cs1" about="#mwt608">Sachs, A. (2 May 1974). "Babylonian Observational Astronomy". <i id="mwFVw"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philosophical_Transactions_of_the_Royal_Society" title="Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society" id="mwFV0">Philosophical Transactions of the Royal Society</a></i>. <b id="mwFV4">276</b> (1257): 43–50 [45 &amp; 48–49]. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bibcode_(identifier)" title="Bibcode (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFV8">Bibcode</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1974RSPTA.276...43S" class="external text" id="mwFWA">1974RSPTA.276...43S</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFWE">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.1098%2Frsta.1974.0008" class="external text" id="mwFWI">10.1098/rsta.1974.0008</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JSTOR_(identifier)" title="JSTOR (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFWM">JSTOR</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwFWQ"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.jstor.org/stable/74273" class="external text" id="mwFWU">74273</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)" title="S2CID (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFWY">S2CID</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwFWc"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:121539390" class="external text" id="mwFWg">121539390</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Philosophical+Transactions+of+the+Royal+Society&amp;rft.atitle=Babylonian+Observational+Astronomy&amp;rft.volume=276&amp;rft.issue=1257&amp;rft.pages=43-50+45+%26+48-49&amp;rft.date=1974-05-02&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1098%2Frsta.1974.0008&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A121539390%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jstor.org%2Fstable%2F74273%23id-name%3DJSTOR&amp;rft_id=info%3Abibcode%2F1974RSPTA.276...43S&amp;rft.aulast=Sachs&amp;rft.aufirst=A.&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APlanet" class="Z3988" about="#mwt608" id="mwFWk"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-burnet-172" id="cite_note-burnet-172" data-mw-footnote-number="171"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwFWo"><a href="#cite_ref-burnet_172-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwFWs"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwFWw">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-burnet-172" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt613" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwFW0" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite book ","href":"./Template:Cite_book"},"params":{"first":{"wt":"John"},"last":{"wt":"Burnet"},"title":{"wt":"Greek philosophy: Thales to Plato"},"date":{"wt":"2007"},"orig-date":{"wt":"1st pub. 1950"},"publisher":{"wt":"Macmillan and Co."},"pages":{"wt":"7–11"},"url":{"wt":"https://books.google.com/books?id=7yUAmmqHHEgC&amp;pg=PR4"},"access-date":{"wt":"7 February 2008"},"isbn":{"wt":"978-1-4067-6601-1"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFBurnet2007" class="citation book cs1" about="#mwt613">Burnet, John (2007) [1st pub. 1950]. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://books.google.com/books?id=7yUAmmqHHEgC&amp;pg=PR4" class="external text" id="mwFW4"><i id="mwFW8">Greek philosophy: Thales to Plato</i></a>. Macmillan and Co. pp.<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwFXA"> </span><span class="nowrap" id="mwFXE">7–</span>11. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFXI">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwFXM"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-1-4067-6601-1" title="Special:BookSources/978-1-4067-6601-1" id="mwFXQ"><bdi id="mwFXU">978-1-4067-6601-1</bdi></a><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwFXY">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwFXc">7 February</span> 2008</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Greek+philosophy%3A+Thales+to+Plato&amp;rft.pages=7-11&amp;rft.pub=Macmillan+and+Co.&amp;rft.date=2007&amp;rft.isbn=978-1-4067-6601-1&amp;rft.aulast=Burnet&amp;rft.aufirst=John&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fbooks.google.com%2Fbooks%3Fid%3D7yUAmmqHHEgC%26pg%3DPR4&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APlanet" class="Z3988" about="#mwt613" id="mwFXg"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-Cooley-173" id="cite_note-Cooley-173" data-mw-footnote-number="172"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwFXk"><a href="#cite_ref-Cooley_173-0" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwFXo"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwFXs">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-Cooley-173" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt616" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwFXw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite journal ","href":"./Template:Cite_journal"},"params":{"last":{"wt":"Cooley"},"first":{"wt":"Jeffrey L."},"title":{"wt":"Inana and Šukaletuda: A Sumerian Astral Myth"},"url":{"wt":"https://www.academia.edu/1247599"},"journal":{"wt":"KASKAL"},"volume":{"wt":"5"},"pages":{"wt":"161–172"},"year":{"wt":"2008"},"issn":{"wt":"1971-8608"},"quote":{"wt":"The Greeks, for example, originally identified the morning and evening stars with two separate deities, Phosphoros and Hesporos respectively. In Mesopotamia, it seems that this was recognized prehistorically. Assuming its authenticity, a cylinder seal from the Erlenmeyer collection attests to this knowledge in southern Iraq as early as the Late Uruk / Jemdet Nasr Period, as do the archaic texts of the period. [...] Whether or not one accepts the seal as authentic, the fact that there is no epithetical distinction between the morning and evening appearances of Venus in any later Mesopotamian literature attests to a very, very early recognition of the phenomenon."},"access-date":{"wt":"26 November 2022"},"archive-date":{"wt":"24 December 2019"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20191224105634/https://www.academia.edu/1247599"},"url-status":{"wt":"live"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFCooley2008" class="citation journal cs1" about="#mwt616">Cooley, Jeffrey L. (2008). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://www.academia.edu/1247599" class="external text" id="mwFX0">"Inana and Šukaletuda: A Sumerian Astral Myth"</a>. <i id="mwFX4">KASKAL</i>. <b id="mwFX8">5</b>: <span class="nowrap" id="mwFYA">161–</span>172. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)" title="ISSN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFYE">ISSN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwFYI"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://search.worldcat.org/issn/1971-8608" class="external text" id="mwFYM">1971-8608</a>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20191224105634/https://www.academia.edu/1247599" class="external text" id="mwFYQ">Archived</a> from the original on 24 December 2019<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwFYU">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwFYY">26 November</span> 2022</span>. <q id="mwFYc">The Greeks, for example, originally identified the morning and evening stars with two separate deities, Phosphoros and Hesporos respectively. In Mesopotamia, it seems that this was recognized prehistorically. Assuming its authenticity, a cylinder seal from the Erlenmeyer collection attests to this knowledge in southern Iraq as early as the Late Uruk / Jemdet Nasr Period, as do the archaic texts of the period. [...] Whether or not one accepts the seal as authentic, the fact that there is no epithetical distinction between the morning and evening appearances of Venus in any later Mesopotamian literature attests to a very, very early recognition of the phenomenon.</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=KASKAL&amp;rft.atitle=Inana+and+%C5%A0ukaletuda%3A+A+Sumerian+Astral+Myth&amp;rft.volume=5&amp;rft.pages=161-172&amp;rft.date=2008&amp;rft.issn=1971-8608&amp;rft.aulast=Cooley&amp;rft.aufirst=Jeffrey+L.&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.academia.edu%2F1247599&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APlanet" class="Z3988" about="#mwt616" id="mwFYg"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-174" id="cite_note-174" data-mw-footnote-number="173"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwFYk"><a href="#cite_ref-174" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwFYo"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwFYs">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-174" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt619" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwFYw" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Cite journal ","href":"./Template:Cite_journal"},"params":{"last":{"wt":"Kurtik"},"first":{"wt":"G. E."},"date":{"wt":"June 1999"},"title":{"wt":"The identification of Inanna with the planet Venus: A criterion for the time determination of the recognition of constellations in ancient Mesopotamia"},"url":{"wt":"http://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/10556799908244112"},"journal":{"wt":"Astronomical &amp; Astrophysical Transactions"},"language":{"wt":"en"},"volume":{"wt":"17"},"issue":{"wt":"6"},"pages":{"wt":"501–513"},"doi":{"wt":"10.1080/10556799908244112"},"bibcode":{"wt":"1999A&amp;AT...17..501K"},"issn":{"wt":"1055-6796"},"access-date":{"wt":"13 July 2022"},"archive-date":{"wt":"16 June 2022"},"archive-url":{"wt":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220616151834/https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/10556799908244112"},"url-status":{"wt":"live"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFKurtik1999" class="citation journal cs1" about="#mwt619">Kurtik, G. E. (June 1999). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="http://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/10556799908244112" class="external text" id="mwFY0">"The identification of Inanna with the planet Venus: A criterion for the time determination of the recognition of constellations in ancient Mesopotamia"</a>. <i id="mwFY4">Astronomical &amp; Astrophysical Transactions</i>. <b id="mwFY8">17</b> (6): <span class="nowrap" id="mwFZA">501–</span>513. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bibcode_(identifier)" title="Bibcode (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFZE">Bibcode</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1999A&amp;AT...17..501K" class="external text" id="mwFZI">1999A<span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwFZM">&amp;</span>AT...17..501K</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFZQ">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.1080%2F10556799908244112" class="external text" id="mwFZU">10.1080/10556799908244112</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)" title="ISSN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFZY">ISSN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwFZc"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://search.worldcat.org/issn/1055-6796" class="external text" id="mwFZg">1055-6796</a>. <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://web.archive.org/web/20220616151834/https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/10556799908244112" class="external text" id="mwFZk">Archived</a> from the original on 16 June 2022<span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwFZo">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwFZs">13 July</span> 2022</span>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Astronomical+%26+Astrophysical+Transactions&amp;rft.atitle=The+identification+of+Inanna+with+the+planet+Venus%3A+A+criterion+for+the+time+determination+of+the+recognition+of+constellations+in+ancient+Mesopotamia&amp;rft.volume=17&amp;rft.issue=6&amp;rft.pages=501-513&amp;rft.date=1999-06&amp;rft.issn=1055-6796&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1080%2F10556799908244112&amp;rft_id=info%3Abibcode%2F1999A%26AT...17..501K&amp;rft.aulast=Kurtik&amp;rft.aufirst=G.+E.&amp;rft_id=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.tandfonline.com%2Fdoi%2Fabs%2F10.1080%2F10556799908244112&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APlanet" class="Z3988" about="#mwt619" id="mwFZw"></span></span></li>
<li about="#cite_note-almagest-175" id="cite_note-almagest-175" data-mw-footnote-number="174"><span rel="mw:referencedBy" class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwFZ0"><a href="#cite_ref-almagest_175-0" id="mwFZ4"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwFZ8">1</span></a> <a href="#cite_ref-almagest_175-1" id="mwFaA"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwFaE">2</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-almagest-175" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt628" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwFaI" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"cite journal ","href":"./Template:Cite_journal"},"params":{"first":{"wt":"Bernard R."},"last":{"wt":"Goldstein"},"title":{"wt":"Saving the phenomena: the background to Ptolemy&apos;s planetary theory"},"journal":{"wt":"Journal for the History of Astronomy"},"volume":{"wt":"28"},"issue":{"wt":"1"},"date":{"wt":"1997"},"pages":{"wt":"1–12"},"bibcode":{"wt":"1997JHA....28....1G"},"doi":{"wt":"10.1177/002182869702800101"},"s2cid":{"wt":"118875902"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFGoldstein1997" class="citation journal cs1" about="#mwt628">Goldstein, Bernard R. (1997). "Saving the phenomena: the background to Ptolemy's planetary theory". <i id="mwFaM">Journal for the History of Astronomy</i>. <b id="mwFaQ">28</b> (1): <span class="nowrap" id="mwFaU">1–</span>12. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bibcode_(identifier)" title="Bibcode (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFaY">Bibcode</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1997JHA....28....1G" class="external text" id="mwFac">1997JHA....28....1G</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFag">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.1177%2F002182869702800101" class="external text" id="mwFak">10.1177/002182869702800101</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)" title="S2CID (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwFao">S2CID</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwFas"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:118875902" class="external text" id="mwFaw">118875902</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+for+the+History+of+Astronomy&amp;rft.atitle=Saving+the+phenomena%3A+the+background+to+Ptolemy%27s+planetary+theory&amp;rft.volume=28&amp;rft.issue=1&amp;rft.pages=1-12&amp;rft.date=1997&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A118875902%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1177%2F002182869702800101&amp;rft_id=info%3Abibcode%2F1997JHA....28....1G&amp;rft.aulast=Goldstein&amp;rft.aufirst=Bernard+R.&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APlanet" class="Z3988" about="#mwt628" id="mwFa0"></span></span></li>
