<li about="#cite_note-207" id="cite_note-207" data-mw-footnote-number="205"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwFz4"><a href="#cite_ref-207" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwFz8"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwF0A">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-207" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt754" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion" id="mwF0E" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""},"parts":[{"template":{"target":{"wt":"Cite tweet ","href":"./Template:Cite_tweet"},"params":{"user":{"wt":"plutokiller"},"last":{"wt":"Brown"},"first":{"wt":"Mike"},"number":{"wt":"1624127764969459713"},"title":{"wt":"The real answer here is to not get too hung up on definitions, which I admit is hard when the IAU tries to make them sound official and clear, but, really, we all understand the intent of the hydrostatic equilibrium point, and the intent is clearly to include Merucry &amp; the moon"}},"i":0}}]}'/><cite id="CITEREFBrown2023" class="citation web cs1" about="#mwt754">Brown, Mike [@plutokiller] (10 February 2023). <a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://twitter.com/plutokiller/status/1624127764969459713" class="external text" id="mwF0I">"The real answer here is to not get too hung up on definitions, which I admit is hard when the IAU tries to make them sound official and clear, but, really, we all understand the intent of the hydrostatic equilibrium point, and the intent is clearly to include Merucry &amp; the moon"</a> (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tweet_(social_media)" title="Tweet (social media)" id="mwF0M">Tweet</a>) <span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwF0Q">–</span> via <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Twitter" title="Twitter" class="mw-redirect" id="mwF0U">Twitter</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.btitle=The+real+answer+here+is+to+not+get+too+hung+up+on+definitions%2C+which+I+admit+is+hard+when+the+IAU+tries+to+make+them+sound+official+and+clear%2C+but%2C+really%2C+we+all+understand+the+intent+of+the+hydrostatic+equilibrium+point%2C+and+the+intent+is+clearly+to+include+Merucry+%26+the+moon&amp;rft.date=2023-02-10&amp;rft.aulast=Brown&amp;rft.aufirst=Mike&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fplutokiller%2Fstatus%2F1624127764969459713&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3APlanet" class="Z3988" about="#mwt754" id="mwF0Y"></span></span></li>
